## Reviewer disagreements (not applied)
- “Estonian month names are registered” is true only for the nominative stem. “detsembril” and “jaanuarist” are not matched, so the reviewer’s date case cannot be written on the month itself without failing the number check. Case sits on kuupäeval / kuupäevast / seisuga / aasta instead.
- “üks järgmistest” and “ühe nimele” are not counted by the checker. Those digits stay.
- Space thousands and “1,57 miljonit TWD” would fail R14 and the pinned bio token.
- Adding 2023 or 2020 next to a ROC year adds a digit the English source does not have (R13).
- Merging the one-line blog paragraphs in 003, 006, 008, 009, 013 and 015 would change the block count.
